---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - SmallTextGen | No Data Collection"
  description="SmallTextGen privacy policy. We collect zero personal data. No cookies, no tracking, no analytics. Your text never leaves your browser. Read our full privacy commitment."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.small-text-gen.com/privacy/"
>
  <Fragment slot="extra-head">
  </Fragment>

  <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-50/90 backdrop-blur-md dark:border-zinc-800/80 dark:bg-zinc-950/90">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl items-center justify-between px-4 py-3">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-semibold text-lg tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
        <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent-600 text-white text-sm font-bold">s</span>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline">SmallTextGen</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="text-sm font-medium text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400 dark:hover:text-accent-300">Back to Generator</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pt-16 pb-16">
    <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Last updated: August 11, 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Our Privacy Promise</h2>
        <p>SmallTextGen is designed to be <strong>private by default</strong>. We do not collect, store, or share any personal information. You don’t need to create an account, provide an email address, or give us any data to use the tool. The text you type is processed entirely within your browser and never sent to any server.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Data We Do NOT Collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Personal information:</strong> We don’t collect names, email addresses, or any identifying data.</li>
          <li><strong>Text input:</strong> The text you type into our generator stays in your browser’s memory. It is never transmitted, stored, or logged.</li>
          <li><strong>Usage analytics:</strong> We do not use Google Analytics, Facebook Pixel, or any third-party tracking service.</li>
          <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> We do not set any first-party cookies. The only data stored is in your browser’s localStorage (your last platform choice and text), which never leaves your device.</li>
          <li><strong>IP addresses:</strong> Our hosting provider (Vercel) may process IP addresses for routing and security purposes as part of standard CDN operations. We do not log or access this data.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Local Storage</h2>
        <p>SmallTextGen uses your browser’s <strong>localStorage</strong> to remember two preferences:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-3">
          <li><strong>Platform preference:</strong> Which platform you selected (e.g., Instagram, Discord). This is stored as “stg_platform”.</li>
          <li><strong>Last text:</strong> The last text you typed, so it’s restored when you return. This is stored as “stg_text”.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">This data is stored exclusively in your browser and is never sent to any server. You can clear it at any time by clearing your browser’s site data for small-text-gen.com.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We use the following third-party services for infrastructure:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-3">
          <li><strong>Vercel:</strong> Hosting and CDN. Vercel may process request metadata (IP address, user agent) for security and performance monitoring. See <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" class="text-accent-600 hover:underline" rel="nofollow noopener">Vercel’s Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Fonts:</strong> We load the Outfit and JetBrains Mono fonts. Google may receive request data when fonts are loaded. For privacy-conscious users, the site functions normally without fonts loaded.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">We do not embed any advertising networks, social media widgets, or third-party scripts beyond what is listed above.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Children’s Privacy</h2>
        <p>SmallTextGen is a general-audience tool. We do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone, including children under 13.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>If we make changes to this privacy policy, we will update the “Last updated” date at the top of this page. Significant changes will be noted on our blog. Since we collect no user data, we cannot notify users directly of changes.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy or our data practices, please reach out. We take privacy seriously and will respond to every inquiry.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>